\f1\fs22 Sarah woke as if from a nightmare, gasping, kicking against the entanglement of her top sheet and defending against her pillow. She\'92d had the visions again, in full saturated colour, panoramic depth of psychedelic fractals coming to devour her and yet somehow do her bidding. She knocked over a bedside table lamp\'97deliberately, which meant she could see it among the swirling images.\
